    "type": "game",
    "name": "AVROPOLIS",
    "steam_appid": 3354230,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I\u2019m Marco Giardina, the solo developer of <strong><i>Avropolis</i></strong> (Pronounced <strong><i>Au-ro-polis</i></strong>).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Avropolis</i></strong> is a VR action-adventure game set in a historical fantasy world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It combines exploration, combat, and puzzles, using a physics-based </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >controller that supports different playstyles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow Leonardo\u2019s journey through detailed environments. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb, explore, avoid traps, fight strange creatures, and solve ancient puzzles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore a Full Campaign in Handcrafted Environments</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete Leonardo\u2019s final mission and discover the secrets of <strong><i>Avropolis</i></strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore freely or move straight to your goal.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve ancient puzzles and environmental challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find different weapons and choose what to carry or store in your saferoom.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Observe your surroundings and make smart choices.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fight Mysterious Enemies and Creatures</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Melee or ranged weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alternative ways such as burning.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make noise to distract enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose stealth wherever possible, or combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face unique mini-bosses.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Manage Your Gear</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your backpack, tactical belt, and saferoom to manage equipment.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Buy Items and Upgrade Equipment</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade certain weapons to unlock attachments or increase power.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy tools like flares, chem-lights, sticky bombs, and C2 explosives.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your backpack and waist storage.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>VR Controls and Accessibility</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free and smooth movement: walk, run, jump, climb, crouch.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play seated or standing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose snap or smooth turning.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjust your height in-game.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story and Voice Acting</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn more by collecting journals and exploring.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hear Leonardo and Frida speak over radio as the story unfolds.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I\u2019m Marco Giardina, the solo developer of <strong><i>Avropolis</i></strong> (Pronounced <strong><i>Au-ro-polis</i></strong>).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Avropolis</i></strong> is a VR action-adventure game set in a historical fantasy world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It combines exploration, combat, and puzzles, using a physics-based </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >controller that supports different playstyles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow Leonardo\u2019s journey through detailed environments. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb, explore, avoid traps, fight strange creatures, and solve ancient puzzles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore a Full Campaign in Handcrafted Environments</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete Leonardo\u2019s final mission and discover the secrets of <strong><i>Avropolis</i></strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore freely or move straight to your goal.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve ancient puzzles and environmental challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find different weapons and choose what to carry or store in your saferoom.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Observe your surroundings and make smart choices.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fight Mysterious Enemies and Creatures</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Melee or ranged weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alternative ways such as burning.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make noise to distract enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose stealth wherever possible, or combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face unique mini-bosses.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Manage Your Gear</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your backpack, tactical belt, and saferoom to manage equipment.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Buy Items and Upgrade Equipment</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade certain weapons to unlock attachments or increase power.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy tools like flares, chem-lights, sticky bombs, and C2 explosives.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your backpack and waist storage.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>VR Controls and Accessibility</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free and smooth movement: walk, run, jump, climb, crouch.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play seated or standing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose snap or smooth turning.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjust your height in-game.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story and Voice Acting</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn more by collecting journals and exploring.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hear Leonardo and Frida speak over radio as the story unfolds.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "AVROPOLIS is a VR action-adventure historical fantasy game with puzzle elements. Explore ancient, mystery-filled atmospheric environments using a physics-based controller that allows different play-styles. Prepare for a once-in-a-lifetime adventure full of discovery and action!",
